Nine original project maintenance/release modules are copied byte-for-byte.
source-provenance.json records each original path, size and SHA-256.
payload-pins.json records private installed paths and the new launcher.
No third-party Python module or entire repository snapshot is bundled.
Runtime programs: Python (PSF), GnuPG (GPL), libarchive/bsdtar (BSD),
and pacman/vercmp (GPL). These are dependencies, not redistributed here.
